  "_comment": [
    "ROLLBACK-ORIGINALS-LEFT-1. The original disks of a machine that a rollback",
    "swapped off: the disks it had before the migration, detached and kept in",
    "Azure. Decided in TWO places: the engine (Get-VmfRollbackOriginalDisks,",
    "asked by Remove-VmfRestoreEarlierDisks -Set rollback) and the run page",
    "(rollbackOriginalDisks in migrations.js), which lists them under Original",
    "disks, not in use and counts them in the slide-out. Both are held to this",
    "one list: tests/unit/RollbackOriginals.Tests.ps1 and",
    "tests/js/rollback-originals.test.js.",
    "The record is rollbackOriginals (vm-state v41); every writer of the rollback",
    "record writes it in the same write. Never listed: a disk marked deleted, a",
    "disk the record says the machine uses now, and an earlier disk of a",
    "restore (the restore's own part lists it). Resource IDs compare in any",
    "letter case. One disk is listed once."
